{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q233", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "piragoru_naal_kodai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem_imagery", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிதையில் ‘சுவரெங்கும் பரவும் ஈரம்’ எதனைக் குறிப்பதாக அமைகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மழையின் எஞ்சிய தடமும் நினைவுகளின் தொடர்ச்சியும்", "B": "வீடு இடிந்து விழுவதை", "C": "வெயிலின் உக்கிரத்தை", "D": "மழைக்கால நோய் பரவலை"}, "explanation": "மழை நின்ற பிறகும் சுவர்களில் தங்கியிருக்கும் ஈரம், மழையின் நினைவுகளையும் இயற்கையின் நிலைபேற்றையும் உணர்த்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the poem, what does the imagery of lingering moisture spreading along walls symbolize?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The enduring footprints of rain and perpetual continuity of memories", "B": "Imminent collapse of the household", "C": "Fierce glare of summer sun", "D": "Spread of waterborne contagion"}, "explanation": "The residual moisture on walls evokes the lingering essence of rain and persistence of emotional impressions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 29, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 29", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 2", "Poetry", "Poetic Imagery"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q234", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "piragoru_naal_kodai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "contemporary_poets_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நவீனக் கவிஞர்களையும் அவர்களின் படைப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. அய்யப்ப மாதவன் - அ) நிலவுப்பூ\n2. சிற்பி பாலசுப்பிரமணியம் - ஆ) மழைக்குப்பிறகும் மழை\n3. சு. வில்வரத்தினம் - இ) துறைமுகம்\n4. சுரதா - ஈ) உயிர்த்தெழும் காலத்துக்காக", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "C": "1-இ, 2-ஈ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ", "D": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ"}, "explanation": "அய்யப்ப மாதவன் - மழைக்குப்பிறகும் மழை; சிற்பி - நிலவுப்பூ; வில்வரத்தினம் - உயிர்த்தெழும் காலத்துக்காக; சுரதா - துறைமுகம். பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the contemporary Tamil poets with their respective celebrated works:\n1. Ayyappa Madhavan - a) Nilavuppoo\n2. Sirpi Balasubramaniam - b) Mazhaikkup Piragum Mazhai\n3. S. Vilvarathinam - c) Thuraimugam\n4. Suradha - d) Uyirthezhum Kaalathukkaaga", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "C": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "Ayyappa Madhavan: b; Sirpi: a; Vilvarathinam: d; Suradha: c. Thus 1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 30, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 30", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 2", "Poetry", "Poets Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q235", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "piragoru_naal_kodai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "genre_modern_poetry", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘பிறகொரு நாள் கோடை’ கவிதை எவ்வகை யாப்பு/கவிதை வடிவத்தைச் சார்ந்தது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆசிரியப்பா", "B": "கலிப்பா", "C": "புதுக்கவிதை (வசன கவிதை வழிவந்த கட்டற்ற வடிவம்)", "D": "வஞ்சிப்பா"}, "explanation": "இக்கவிதை யாப்புக் கட்டுப்பாடுகளற்ற, படிமங்களும் குறியீடுகளும் நிறைந்த நவீனப் புதுக்கவிதை வடிவத்தைச் சார்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which poetic genre and metrical structure does the poem 'Piragoru Naal Kodai' belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Classical Asiriyappa", "B": "Kalippa", "C": "Pudhukkavithai (Modern free verse)", "D": "Vanchippa"}, "explanation": "'Piragoru Naal Kodai' is composed in modern Tamil free verse (Pudhukkavithai) untethered to strict metric meters."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 30, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 30", "url": null, "sourc