{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q322", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "naalvagai_poruthangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kaala_vazhuvamaidhi_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அரசன் நாளை வருகிறான்’ என்பது எவ்வகை வழுவமைதி?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பால் வழுவமைதி", "B": "கால வழுவமைதி (வருவான் என்னும் எதிர்காலத்திற்குப் பதில் நிகழ்காலத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துதல்)", "C": "இட வழுவமைதி", "D": "மரபு வழுவமைதி"}, "explanation": "நாளை என்பது எதிர்காலம்; ஆனால் உறுதியைக் குறிப்பதற்காக ‘வருகிறான்’ என நிகழ்காலமாகப் பயன்படுத்தியதால் ‘கால வழுவமைதி’ ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Saying 'The King arrives tomorrow' (Arasan naalai varugiraan - using present tense for future) exemplifies what?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paal Vazhuvamaidhi", "B": "Kaala Vazhuvamaidhi (Tense anomaly expressing certainty)", "C": "Ida Vazhuvamaidhi", "D": "Marabu Vazhuvamaidhi"}, "explanation": "Using present tense for a definite future action denotes Kaala Vazhuvamaidhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "