{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q323", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "naalvagai_poruthangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "marabu_vazhuvamaidhi_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘காகம் கத்தும்’ என்பது மரபு வழு; ‘காகம் கரையும்’ என்பது சரியான மரபு. ‘கத்தும் குயிலோசை சற்றே வந்து காதில் படவேணும்’ என்று பாரதியார் பாடியது எவ்வகை வழுவமைதி?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திணை வழுவமைதி", "B": "கால வழுவமைதி", "C": "மரபு வழுவமைதி", "D": "இட வழுவமைதி"}, "explanation": "குயில் கூவும் என்பதே மரபு; ஆனால் பாரதியார் கவிதை நயத்திற்காகக் ‘கத்தும் குயிலோசை’ எனப் பாடியது சான்றோர் மரபாக ஏற்கப்பட்டு ‘மரபு வழுவமைதி’ ஆனது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Kuyil koovum is standard bird lore; Bharati singing 'Katthum kuyilosai' (the shrieking cuckoo sound) is permitted under which category?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thinai Vazhuvamaidhi", "B": "Kaala Vazhuvamaidhi", "C": "Marabu Vazhuvamaidhi (Traditional idiom license)", "D": "Ida Vazhuvamaidhi"}, "explanation": "Poetic license violating conventional animal call idiom is classified as Marabu Vazhuvamaidhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation