{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q324", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "naalvagai_poruthangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vazhu_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வழு நிலைகளைப் பொருத்துக:\n1. செழியன் வந்தது - அ) பால் வழு\n2. கண்ணகி உண்டான் - ஆ) திணை வழு\n3. நேற்று வருவான் - இ) இட வழு\n4. நான் வந்தாய் - ஈ) கால வழு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ", "C": "1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-ஆ", "D": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ"}, "explanation": "செழியன் வந்தது - திணை வழு (ஆ); கண்ணகி உண்டான் - பால் வழு (அ); நேற்று வருவான் - கால வழு (ஈ); நான் வந்தாய் - இட வழு (இ). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the ungrammatical sentences with their specific error types (Vazhu):\n1. Chezhiyan vandhadhu - a) Gender error (Paal vazhu)\n2. Kannagi undaan - b) Class error (Thinai vazhu)\n3. Netru varuvaan - c) Person error (Ida vazhu)\n4. Naan vandhaai - d) Tense error (Kaala vazhu)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b", "D": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c"}, "explanation": "1: Thinai vazhu (b); 2: Paal vazhu (a); 3: Kaala vazhu (d); 4: Ida vazhu (c)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": 